# Offline NuGet install on an air-gapped server (see dotnet/offline/READ-ME-FIRST.txt).
# The instructions are committed; the 135 MB of packages and the extracted cache are not.
dotnet/offline-packages/
dotnet/packages-cache/
# Activating the offline feed means copying dotnet/offline/nuget.config up to dotnet/.
# That copy is machine-local: committing it would point every other clone at a folder
# that is not in the repo, turning their restore into NU1101.
dotnet/nuget.config
